&Q000425 = A tigi (?) to Ninurta for Šu-Suen (Šu-Suen D)
@composite
#project: etcslatf/inter
#atf: use unicode
#atf: use math
#etcsl: text-id=c.2.4.4.4
#key: after http://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/cgi-bin/etcsl.cgi?text=c.2.4.4.4&display=Crit&charenc=gcirc#

@div barsud A

A.1. ur-saŋ ul gal-le-eš nir gaba#-ŋal₂ zag piriŋ ul sig₇-ga
#lem: ursaŋ[warrior]; ul[distant time]; gal[big]; nir[lordly]; gabaŋal[forceful]; zag[side]; piriŋ[lion]; ul[bud]; sissig[green-yellow]
#tr.en: Ancient warrior, greatly respected and forceful, with the strength of a full-grown lion! 
#etcsl: line-id=A.1

#etcsl#cite Cited in OB catalogue from Nibru (N3), 0.2.06, line 33 (?)

A.2. {d}nin-urta X mar#-uru₅ ug gal šen-šen-na ru-ru-gu₂
#lem: Ninurtak[1]DN; X; marru[stormwind]; ug[lion]; gal[big]; šen[battle]; rugu[withstand]
#tr.en: @wDN{Ninurta}, …… flood, great lion, fierce opponent in battle! 
#etcsl: line-id=A.2

A.3. a₂-ŋal₂ uŋ₃ erim₂ X RA# SU %e uru₂ %s gul-lu a₂-dam sahar-re-eš gi₄
#lem: aŋal[strong]; uŋ[people]; erim[enemy]; X; X; X; uru[city]; gul[destroy]; adam[habitation]; sahar[soil]; gi[turn]
#tr.en: Mighty one, who …… the enemy peoples, destroyer of cities, who turns the settlements into dust! 
#etcsl: line-id=A.3

A.4. {d}nin-urta am gal gud-si-AŠ bad₃ gal |ŠU.KAD₄|-|ŠU.KAD₄|-e
#lem: Ninurtak[1]DN; am[wild bull]; gal[big]; gud.si.AŠ[battering ram]; bad[wall]; gal[big]; X
#tr.en: @wDN{Ninurta}, great wild bull, a battering ram who …… great walls! 

#etcsl: line-id=A.4

@div trailer 

A.5. bar-sud-am₃
#lem: barsud[musical notation]
#tr.en: @fsux{Barsud}. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.5

@end trailer

@end barsud

@div šagbatuku B

B.6. a-ma-ru ki-bal-še₃ hu-luh-ha gaba-šu-ŋar nu-tuku
#lem: amaru[flood]; kibala[rebel land]; huluh[frightened]; gabašuŋar[rival]; tuku[acquire]
#tr.en: A flood which frightens the rebel lands, without rival! @wDN{Ninurta}, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.6

B.7. {d}nin-urta i-lim u₅ (1:su niŋ₂-ŋir₂ ud ŋar A MUŠ₃# [...]:1)
#lem: Ninurtak[1]DN; ilim[radiance]; u[ride]; su[flesh]; niŋŋir[lightning bolt]; ud[storm]; ŋar[put]; X; X; X
#tr.en: deathly hush, @varh[t2444.v1]{…… bolt of lightning (?), 
