#etcsl: line-id=B.8

B.9. e₂-šu-me-ša₄ ki-tuš kug igi-šu-galam ki nam tar#-[re]-za
#lem: Ešumeša[1]TN; kituš[dwelling place]; kug[purify]; Igišugalam[1]TN; ki[place]; nam[fate]; tar[cut]
#tr.en: When he directs big bulls and big sheep to the main courtyard of your @wTN{E-šu-me-ša}, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.9

B.10. kisal mah-ba! gud gal udu gal-e si um-ma#-[ni]-sa₂
#lem: kisal[courtyard]; mah[great]; gud[bull]; gal[big]; udu[sheep]; gal[big]; si[horn]; sa[equal]
#tr.en: the holy residence, the @wTN{Igi-šu-galam} in which the fates are determined, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.10

